  "published": "2026-10-27T21:32:31.683Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.7.6: faster lossy (VarDCT) decoding with lower memory use: the edge-preserving filter runs as one loop per stage, Gaborish and EPF filter in place (no second set of planes), Gaborish slides a 3x3 window, unrolled sRGB/PQ curves. 12 MP decode about 1.1x faster (ToSrgb 1.17x), peak memory about 40 % lower. Output is byte-identical to 0.7.2.",
